/-!
---
title: UNREACH is NL-complete
type: theorem
---
UNREACH, the complement of REACH, is NL-complete under first-order
reductions: a reduction to REACH is a reduction of the complement to
UNREACH, and NL is closed under complement.
-/

namespace Lax485149.UnreachNLComplete

open FirstOrder FirstOrder.Language
open Lax904597.Problems Lax904597.Interpretations Lax904597.Relativized Lax904597.SecondOrder
